    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Incident Management & Human Approval Workflow\n\n- Exercise 1: Webhook trigger + severity routing\n- Exercise 2: Throttle check (static data) + Slack alerts\n- Exercise 3: SLA Wait (10 min) + Twilio SMS escalation\n- Exercise 4: Interactive Slack approval + webhook resume + decision routing\n\nSLA testing tip: lower the SLA Wait to 30 seconds when demonstrating.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 400
      },
