        1104,
        512
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Exercise 1 & 2 — Intake, Throttle & Routing\nWebhook receives the incident, the Code node throttles duplicates via workflow static data, and the Switch routes by severity (CRITICAL / INFO / Other).",
